WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.568
Your favorite president and your least favorite gangster did the same

00:03.568 --> 00:05.190
thing this week. We checked.

00:05.190 --> 00:08.441
Careful, Chalk — you're gonna start a war in the comments

00:08.441 --> 00:09.919
before the show even starts.

00:09.919 --> 00:11.473
Good. That's the show.

00:11.473 --> 00:15.737
This is Pirate Radio. Out here, nobody's good or bad —

00:15.737 --> 00:18.837
a king, a cartel, a whole government —

00:18.837 --> 00:21.938
everybody gets judged by one thing: their actions.

00:21.938 --> 00:24.999
Every file, we take the labels off —

00:24.999 --> 00:28.443
pirate, patriot, terrorist, gangster — and run the receipts:

00:28.443 --> 00:32.652
who wrote the label, what they gain, what the person actually

00:32.652 --> 00:33.035
did.

00:33.035 --> 00:36.483
So settle it below: same actions — one's a hero,

00:36.483 --> 00:39.587
one's a criminal. Who are YOU defending, and why?

00:39.587 --> 00:42.346
Best answers get read on the next file.

00:42.346 --> 00:43.380
Stay Sharked Up.
